    "name": "VKS Operations API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The VKS (Visual Knowledge Share) JSON REST API provides programmatic access to pull guidebook and production information out of VKS and manage Work Orders and operations. It supports bi-directional integration with ERP, MES, QMS, and LMS systems for manufacturing environments. Supports up to 50 requests per minute for SaaS deployments.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: VKS Support",
      "type": "text/plain"
